        "answer": 0,
        "explanation": "Le pizze is plural, so piacciono."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-08-t2",
      "rule": "Mi piace + infinito",
      "tip": "For actions use piace + infinitive, even for two actions.",
      "example": {
